  "description": "What really matters on a road bike is the ride feel. Yes, bike weight and aerodynamics matter if you are a top pro, but high-strung disposable race bikes are not designed to be enjoyable to ride. The Goodship takes a step back from the delicate, high-strung race machines and instead is designed to be something you will love to ride every day, and for year after year too!\n\nStill a fully capable race-bike, the Goodship is primarily focused on the feeling that comes from riding it. The Goodship’s ultra high-end steel Drawnright tubeset is designed to work perfectly with a matching ENVE carbon fiber fork. You’ll recognize the Goodship’s unique road feel immediately whenever you hit the road. Built with a full Shimano Ultegra groupset, FSA components and Continental tires to give you a parts build that is both lightweight and reliable.",
